h deep margin F  Representative sample of medial fibroadipose tissue with superior margin Also received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number are two pieces of white yellow adipose tissue REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm in dimension from which two white tan lymph nodes are identified measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm  These are bisected and fully submitted in cassettes G and H  Also received   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  contents left axilla  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 7cm specimen of adipose tissue  from which multiple lymph nodes are identified  Representative sections of these lymph nodes are submitted in I J  Resident  SAMANTHA J  PULLIAM  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  Thomas L Toth  M D  PART A  LYMPH NODE  LEFT AXILLA  SENTINEL   EXCISION PART B  LYMPH NODES  LEFT AXILLA   EXCISION PART C  BREAST  LEFT   RE EXCISION   report_end  , Excisional_biopsy_(Lumpectomy).
