le tan pink lymph nodes  ranging in size from 0 2cm to 0 5cm  Sectioning reveals one 0 5cm lymph node to have a tan to white  smooth cut surface  The remainder have a tan cut surface  Section Code A B   deep resection margin with biopsy cavity C D   superficial fat resection margin with biopsy cavity E H   biopsy cavity  radial sections I J   breast  two representative sections K   skin with scar  two representative sections L M   nipple  trisected  submitted in entirety N O   axillary lymph nodes  one half submitted X Y   additional axillary soft tissue Resident  Jacqueline Haas  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  David William Rattner  M D  Kathleen Hamilton  ANP PART   BREAST  RIGHT    report_end  , Mastectomy.
