ion from it  1 0cm away  is a well demarcated rubbery tan lesion measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm and extending to within 0 5cm of the deep resection margin  The remaining breast parenchyma is composed of yellow to tan fibrous and fatty soft tissue with an unremarkable cut surface  The tissue is searched for lymph nodes but none are identified  Representative sections are submitted as follows  A F  scar to deep margin  lesion submitted entirely  G  rubbery lesion to deep margin  lesion submitted entirely  H I  uninvolved parenchyma away from lesions Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  endometrial curettage  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 1cm collection of tiny tan soft tissue fragments which is wrapped in mesh and submitted entirely as cassette J  Please note that the specimen is delicate and may not survive processing  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  right and left adnexa  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm ovary with an attached 5 5cm fallopian tube which is 0 5cm in average diameter  The serosal surfaces are smooth and unremarkable except the presence of several small  0 2cm on average  paratubal cyst  The ovary and tube are serially sectioned to reveal unremarkable ovarian parenchyma and a fallopian tube with a patent lumen  Representative sections of ovary and tube are submitted as cassettes K L  Also received in the same container is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm ovary with a smooth serosal surface  Sectioning reveals unremarkable ovarian parenchyma  Representative tissue is submitted as cassette M  Also received in the same container are two sections of fallopian tube measuring 4 0cm and 2 5cm in length  Each has an average diameter of 0 5cm  The serosal surfaces are smooth and unremarkable except for the presence of several small  0 3cm on average  paratubal cysts  Sectioning reveals an unremarkable cut surface with patent 